# Analysis outputs ARE tracked: the figures, CSVs and RESULTS.md are the
# deliverables of this project, and keeping them in the repository means the
# results are readable without installing anything or sourcing the recordings.
# They stay reproducible via `python analyze_csi.py`.

# The one exception, and it is not a result: built, tried along the foot of the
# presentation's title slide, and removed, because at 0.85 in a strip of real
# channel data read as a decorative stripe rather than as data. Ignored rather
# than left untracked so `git status` stays quiet and the next genuinely new
# file is visible. Rebuild with `make_slide_figures.py --only titleband`.
docs/figures/slides/title_band.png

